# Readable code

Thin controllers. One Transfer Engine (`TransfersService.executeTransfer`) is the only code that mutates wallet balances or money ledger rows.
Early returns. If two ways work, pick the one a judge can follow in 30 seconds.
Prisma lives only in `apps/api`. Browser never calls Nest; Next.js Server Actions are the BFF.
JWT in httpOnly cookies per app origin.
